Correction we have the Kahili room on Sunday until 15:30.



On Sun, Oct 26, 2014 at 7:40 PM, Joseph Salowey <joe@salowey.net> wrote:

> Below are the details for the upcoming meetings along with a very drafty
> agenda:
>
> TLS November 2014 Interim Meeting
>
> November 9, 2014, 9:30 - 13:30 -  Kahili room
>
> --------------------------------------------------------------------
>
> Agenda (Draft)
>
> ---------------------
>
> Focus on TLS 1.3 topics (draft-ietf-tls-tls13
> <https://tools.ietf.org/wg/tls/draft-ietf-tls-tls13/>)
>
>    1.
>
>    1.3 Session Resumption
>    2.
>
>    1.3 Key Refresh/Client auth
>    3.
>
>    1.3 (0-RTT)
>
>
>
> IETF 91 TLS Meeting
>
> November 13, 2014, 9 - 11:30 - Coral 5
>
> ------------------------------
>
> Agenda (Draft)
>
> --------------------
>
>    1.
>
>    RC4 (if necessary)
>
> draft-ietf-tls-prohibiting-rc4
> <https://tools.ietf.org/wg/tls/draft-ietf-tls-prohibiting-rc4/>
>
>    1.
>
>    Downgrade SCSV
>
> draft-ietf-tls-downgrade-scsv
> <https://tools.ietf.org/wg/tls/draft-ietf-tls-downgrade-scsv/>
>
>    1.
>
>    Session Hash
>
> draft-ietf-tls-session-hash
> <https://tools.ietf.org/wg/tls/draft-ietf-tls-session-hash/>
>
>    1.
>
>    Finite Field DHE negotiation
>
> draft-ietf-tls-negotiated-ff-dhe
> <https://tools.ietf.org/wg/tls/draft-ietf-tls-negotiated-ff-dhe/>
>
>    1.
>
>    TLS 1.3 Topics continued/Recap
>
> draft-ietf-tls-tls13 <https://tools.ietf.org/wg/tls/draft-ietf-tls-tls13/>
>
>

--001a113a6290fa2cd605067459b4
